EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Welcome to my home, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I was just sitting down to write a
poem about {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}¡Ay!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Qué susto!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Menos mal que eres tú!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Casi se me sale el corazón!
Estoy leyendo un libro de terror y
por la noche me pongo muy tensa,
{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Pero si eres tú, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Vaya sorpresa, justo ahora
estaba pensando en ti!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Good evening{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'm just having a relaxing night at
home.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} You should stay awhile!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Bonsoir{{TAG:0007:0007:}} !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}J'aime rester chez moi quand il fait
nuit.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Reste, on va papoter un peu.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bu saatte misafir beklemiyordum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
o yüzden çok hoş bir sürpriz
oldu,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
